    "Query edges use clamped floor/min indices; count cells are Ioc. Error holds on closures.",
    "The lower theorem assumes success-event measurability and permits arbitrary outputs and independent seed spaces.",
    "Rank recovery is earlier work, not a new result of this manuscript."
